        "message": "<strong>Sign in with a Google Account:</strong> Log in using your existing Google account. A separate “Gemini account” is not required."
    },
    "modalStep3": {
        "message": "<strong>Generate an API Key:</strong> After logging in, click on the “Get API key” button (usually at the top). Create a new key within an existing or new project."
